  "text": "## WHY RATES VARY  \n### SmartSaver Rates (Variable)  \n**Our rates change because:**\n1. **Bank of England decisions:** BoE raises/lowers base rate\n2. **Market conditions:** Deposit rates in market change\n3. **FirstUK strategy:** Competitive positioning\n4. **Cost of funds:** Deposit costs change with market  \n**Your benefit:** If market rates fall, you're not locked into old rate  \n**Your risk:** If rates rise, you keep new higher rate  \n---",
